{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgHLKkNaWjrLXnsNMDBq3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I updated both web lane files for day22, which covered lane-days D09 (CSRF) and D10 (upload). I only edited these two files and ran no GM modes or tests.\n\n- **`reference/techniques/web.md`** (151 lines): added day-by-day entries for D09 \"Forged With Care\" and D10 \"Uploading Expectations\". D09 is a CSRF that the server judges only by the `Sec-Fetch-Site: cross-site` header; it took 70 s to CORRECT. D10 is an upload of an `.html` file containing `{{objective}}`, which the template preview fills in with the proof; it took 58 s. Each entry has the exact request, the new clue keys and error spellings, and the success JSON shape. I added CSRF, upload and new route-word values to the variant axes, plus cues and pitfalls. The main pitfall: both Time Trials came back `solver_incomplete` after about 41 s because the generic `lib.web` race has no handler for a new bug class. The app's stated rules (token required, \"txt only\") were never enforced. I shortened the D06–D08 entries to make room.\n- **`reference/coverage/web.md`** (163 lines; the JSON block is valid and the Recognition cues section is 50 lines): CSRF is marked `seen D09` and upload `seen D10`. I added follow-on rows for both (CSRF token/SameSite variants, upload filter bypass). SSTI and command injection are now \"very high\" because D10 already showed a template engine, and XXE moved up to priority 1.\n- **Readiness gaps:** I dropped the CSRF and upload gaps. I added two prebuild gaps (a Sec-Fetch-*/Referer/Origin header matrix, and upload filter bypass) and one note asking lib/ to absorb the day22 `csrf()`/`upload()` handlers and skip the 40 s race on expired targets. That leaves 25 prebuild gaps. None of them can be built yet: `hctf prebuild` still has no `web` lane, even though `lib/web/` now exists."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":836,"cache_read_input_tokens":70602,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":836},"output_tokens":677,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4a36620c-cc4e-43c4-b504-292458b62d8d","uuid":"924df04f-7782-43c9-9f9b-72b8e076a6a4","timestamp":"2026-10-22T13:12:54.465Z","request_id":"req_011CgHLKk3yHsvHpcjEW9Asb"}
